345 0 obj
<<
/Title (nanoCalc-GPT is a small transformer trained only on arithmetic examples, predicting the next token. I started with addition of two numbers and then extended the same model to all four operations \(+, -, *, /\). The central design goal was to stop the model from memorizing and force it to find the pattern. Every decision below comes from a problem I hit while training, and each one is a change to the data or the loss rather than to the model size.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 199 0 R
>>
endobj
